               7                     !
               8                     !***********************************************************************
               9                     !  this subroutine is the basic time stepping driver.  it does the
              10                     !  gaussian quadrature integrations to compute the adiabatic spectral
              11                     !  tendencies for the model variables. these tendencies are adjusted
              12                     !  with a semi-implicit method to make the model stable for long
              13                     !  time steps.  time steps are made with a time filter to remove
              14                     !  any computational modes.
              15                     !
              16                     !  modify to f90 by C-H Lee and sort by River Chen in 2015
              17                     !
              18                     !***********************************************************************
              19                     !
